    "created_at": "2017-03-14T16:04:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-14T16:04:41Z",
    "body": "Given that Edge and Firefox effectively have long behavior already, perhaps a good way forward here is to file a bug against WebKit to make sure they're aware there's a plan on changing this and then start working on tests and standard changes. This seems relatively uncontroversial, but better safe than sorry.",
